WEBVTT

00:00:25.640 --> 00:00:27.480
(FILM REEL SCRATCHING)

00:00:28.440 --> 00:00:30.120
(BACKGROUND CHATTER)

00:00:32.640 --> 00:00:34.240
Is this on?
INTERVIEWER: That's fine.

00:00:34.320 --> 00:00:37.000
I can break through walls,
I just can't...

00:00:37.080 --> 00:00:39.160
That's fine.
I can't get this on.

00:00:39.240 --> 00:00:42.160
Mr. Incredible...
Do you have
a secret identity?

00:00:42.240 --> 00:00:43.560
MR. INCREDIBLE

00:00:43.680 --> 00:00:44.800
Every superhero
has a secret identity.

00:00:44.880 --> 00:00:46.600
I don't know
a single one
who doesn't.

00:00:46.680 --> 00:00:49.840
Who wants the pressure of
being super all the time?

00:00:51.880 --> 00:00:53.680
Of course I have
a secret identity.

00:00:55.080 --> 00:00:57.760
Can you see me in this
at the supermarket?
Come on.

00:00:57.840 --> 00:01:00.000
Who'd want to go
shopping as Elastigirl,
know what I mean?

00:01:02.200 --> 00:01:04.800
Superladies, they're always
trying to tell you their
secret identity.

00:01:04.880 --> 00:01:06.280
FROZONE

00:01:06.360 --> 00:01:09.120
Think it'll strengthen
the relationship
or something.

00:01:09.200 --> 00:01:14.600
I said, "Girl, I don't
want to know about your
mild-mannered alter ego."

00:01:14.720 --> 00:01:19.200
I mean, you tell me
you're a super-mega-
ultra-lightning-babe,

00:01:19.320 --> 00:01:23.600
that's all right with me.
I'm good. I'm good.

00:01:23.680 --> 00:01:25.360
No matter how many times
you save the world,

00:01:25.440 --> 00:01:29.120
it always manages
to get back in
jeopardy again.

00:01:29.200 --> 00:01:32.640
Sometimes I just want it
to stay saved, you know?

00:01:32.720 --> 00:01:34.760
For a little bit.
I feel like the maid.

00:01:34.840 --> 00:01:36.040
"I just cleaned up
this mess.

00:01:36.160 --> 00:01:38.760
"Can we keep it clean
for ten minutes?"

00:01:38.840 --> 00:01:40.560
INTERVIEWER:
I could get
to that point.

00:01:40.640 --> 00:01:43.520
"Please?"
We're not finished.

00:01:43.600 --> 00:01:46.960
Sometimes I think
I'd just like the
simple life, you know?

00:01:47.080 --> 00:01:49.480
Relax a little
and raise a family.

00:01:49.600 --> 00:01:51.320
Settle down?
Are you kidding?

00:01:51.400 --> 00:01:52.680
I'm at the top
of my game!

00:01:52.760 --> 00:01:55.480
I'm up there
with the big dogs!
Girls, come on.

00:01:55.560 --> 00:01:57.640
Leave the saving of
the world to the men?

00:01:57.760 --> 00:01:59.000
I don't think so.

00:02:00.320 --> 00:02:01.360
I don't think so.

00:02:11.200 --> 00:02:13.000
(POLICE SIREN WAILS)

00:02:19.040 --> 00:02:21.080
(OVER RADIO)
We interrupt
for a bulletin.

00:02:21.200 --> 00:02:24.200
A high-speed pursuit
between police and
armed gunmen is underway,

00:02:24.280 --> 00:02:26.760
traveling northbound
on San Pablo Ave.

00:02:33.120 --> 00:02:34.280
Yeah, I've got time.

00:03:00.240 --> 00:03:01.880
Mr. Incredible.

00:03:06.320 --> 00:03:07.320
What is it, ma'am?

00:03:07.440 --> 00:03:09.680
My cat, Squeaker,
won't come down.

00:03:09.760 --> 00:03:10.960
(CAT MEOWS)

00:03:12.320 --> 00:03:15.640
Certainly.
I suggest you stand clear.
There could be trouble.

00:03:15.720 --> 00:03:17.080
No, he's quite tame.

00:03:17.160 --> 00:03:18.480
(GUNFIRE)

00:03:19.440 --> 00:03:20.640
(GRUNTS)

00:03:23.480 --> 00:03:24.640
(MEOWS)

00:03:25.800 --> 00:03:27.080
(BEEPING)

00:03:28.640 --> 00:03:30.160
(SIRENS WAIL)

00:03:30.840 --> 00:03:32.160
Let go now.

00:03:34.320 --> 00:03:35.800
(CAT YOWLS)

00:03:47.760 --> 00:03:50.360
Thank you, Mr. Incredible.
You've done it again.

00:03:50.480 --> 00:03:52.520
You're the best.
No, I'm just here to help.

00:03:52.640 --> 00:03:55.040
(OVER RADIO) All units.
We have a tour bus robbery...

00:03:55.120 --> 00:03:57.520
Tour bus robbery.
I've still got time.

00:03:57.640 --> 00:03:59.880
Officers. Ma'am.
Squeaker.

00:04:00.680 --> 00:04:01.880
Cool!
Ready for take-off!

00:04:01.960 --> 00:04:02.960
What the...

00:04:03.040 --> 00:04:04.280
Who are you
supposed to be?

00:04:04.360 --> 00:04:05.600
I'm Incrediboy.

00:04:05.720 --> 00:04:07.280
What? No.

00:04:07.360 --> 00:04:09.640
You're that kid
from the fan club.

00:04:09.720 --> 00:04:12.360
(STAMMERING) Brophy.
Brody. Buddy! Buddy!

00:04:12.480 --> 00:04:14.280
My name is Incrediboy.

00:04:14.360 --> 00:04:16.480
I've been nice,
I've stood for photos,

00:04:16.560 --> 00:04:19.120
signed every
scrap of paper
you pushed at me...

00:04:19.200 --> 00:04:21.800
No, don't worry
about training me.
I know your moves,

00:04:21.880 --> 00:04:24.840
crime fighting style,
favorite catch phrases,
everything!

00:04:24.920 --> 00:04:26.680
I'm your number one fan!

00:04:29.920 --> 00:04:31.720
Hey! Hey, wait!

00:04:38.160 --> 00:04:39.520
(MUTTERING)

00:04:41.000 --> 00:04:42.080
INCREDIBLE: You know,

00:04:42.280 --> 00:04:46.160
you can tell a lot about
a woman by the contents
of her purse,

00:04:46.240 --> 00:04:49.160
but maybe that's not
what you had in mind.

00:04:49.240 --> 00:04:50.240
Hey, look...

00:04:50.360 --> 00:04:51.400
(GRUNTS)

00:04:55.920 --> 00:04:57.160
Elastigirl.

00:04:57.240 --> 00:04:59.240
Mr. Incredible.

00:05:00.240 --> 00:05:01.760
It's all right.
I've got him.

00:05:01.840 --> 00:05:02.840
Sure, you've got him.

00:05:02.920 --> 00:05:05.000
I just took him
out for you.
Sure, you did.

00:05:05.080 --> 00:05:06.360
His attention
was on me.

00:05:06.440 --> 00:05:07.840
A fact I exploited
to do my job.

00:05:07.920 --> 00:05:09.120
My job, you mean.

00:05:09.200 --> 00:05:10.800
A simple thank you
will suffice.

00:05:10.880 --> 00:05:13.040
Thanks, but I don't
need any help.

00:05:13.120 --> 00:05:15.120
Whatever happened
to "ladies first"?

00:05:15.200 --> 00:05:17.360
Well, whatever happened
to equal treatment?

00:05:17.440 --> 00:05:20.040
Look, the lady
got me first.

00:05:20.120 --> 00:05:22.200
Well, we could share,
you know.

00:05:22.280 --> 00:05:23.280
I work alone.

00:05:23.400 --> 00:05:25.920
Well, I think
you need to be more

00:05:26.920 --> 00:05:28.040
flexible.

00:05:28.120 --> 00:05:30.360
Are you doing
anything later?

00:05:30.440 --> 00:05:32.920
I have
a previous engagement.

00:05:41.760 --> 00:05:43.080
(WHISTLES)

00:05:44.760 --> 00:05:46.320
Now, you just stay here.

00:05:46.400 --> 00:05:49.320
They usually pick up
the garbage in an hour.

00:05:49.440 --> 00:05:50.720
FROZONE:
Hey, Incredible!

00:05:50.800 --> 00:05:52.080
Hey, Frozone!

00:05:52.160 --> 00:05:53.800
Shouldn't you be
getting ready?

00:05:53.880 --> 00:05:55.560
I still got time.

00:05:55.640 --> 00:05:56.960
(CROWD SCREAMING)

00:05:57.320 --> 00:05:59.160
WOMAN:
He's gonna jump!

00:06:13.440 --> 00:06:15.320
SANSWEET: I think
you broke something.

00:06:15.440 --> 00:06:18.600
With counseling,
I think you'll come
to forgive me.

00:06:18.680 --> 00:06:20.480
Wait a minute.

00:06:21.360 --> 00:06:23.480
(SANSWEET MOANING)

00:06:24.080 --> 00:06:25.360
(BEEPING)

00:06:38.000 --> 00:06:39.200
(BEEPING SPEEDS UP)

00:06:49.880 --> 00:06:52.520
(COUGHING)
Bomb Voyage.

00:06:52.640 --> 00:06:53.800
Mr. Incredible...!

00:06:53.880 --> 00:06:56.720
BUDDY:
And Incrediboy!

00:06:56.840 --> 00:06:58.360
VOYAGE: Incrediboy?

00:06:59.360 --> 00:07:01.800
Aren't you curious
about how I get
around so fast?

00:07:01.880 --> 00:07:03.240
I have rocket boots.

00:07:03.360 --> 00:07:04.800
Go home, Buddy. Now.
What?

00:07:04.880 --> 00:07:05.880
Little oaf...!

00:07:05.960 --> 00:07:06.960
Can we talk?

00:07:07.040 --> 00:07:09.720
You always say
be true to yourself,

00:07:09.840 --> 00:07:12.640
but you never say
which part to be
true to.

00:07:12.720 --> 00:07:14.960
Well, I've finally
figured out who I am.

00:07:15.040 --> 00:07:17.480
I am your ward.
Incrediboy!

00:07:17.560 --> 00:07:20.640
And now, you have
officially carried
it too far, Buddy.

00:07:20.720 --> 00:07:23.000
This is because
I don't have powers,
isn't it?

00:07:23.080 --> 00:07:25.160
Not every superhero
has powers, you know.

00:07:25.240 --> 00:07:27.000
You can be super
without them.

00:07:27.080 --> 00:07:30.520
I invented these.
I can fly.
Can you fly?

00:07:30.600 --> 00:07:32.640
Fly home, Buddy.
I work alone.

00:07:32.800 --> 00:07:34.960
And your outfit is
totally ridiculous!

00:07:35.040 --> 00:07:36.400
Just give me
one chance!

00:07:36.560 --> 00:07:38.080
I'll show you.
I'll go get the police.

00:07:38.160 --> 00:07:39.280
Buddy, don't!

00:07:39.360 --> 00:07:40.400
It'll only take
a second, really.

00:07:40.480 --> 00:07:42.840
No, stop!
There's a bomb!

00:07:44.600 --> 00:07:47.000
Let go, you're wrecking
my flight pattern.

00:07:47.080 --> 00:07:49.960
I can do this
if you let go!
Will you just...

00:07:50.080 --> 00:07:53.280
I'm trying to help! Stop!
Let go of my cape!

00:07:55.920 --> 00:07:57.360
(BEEPING)

00:08:00.000 --> 00:08:01.360
(BEEPING SPEEDS UP)

00:08:05.600 --> 00:08:07.120
(TRAIN WHISTLE BLOWS)

